    <sys:String x:Key="LOCSsQuickSearchInfo" xml:space="preserve">The plugin uses the functionality of the QuickSearch plugin.
To use it, you must validate the "successstory" or "ss" command.    
        
Here is the list of commands:</sys:String>

    <sys:String x:Key="LOCSsQuickSearchCmd1" xml:space="preserve">This command searches for a list of games with a specific time to full unlock.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCSsQuickSearchCmd2" xml:space="preserve">This command searches for a list of games with a specific percent unlocked.</sys:String>


    <!-- PlayniteAchievementsSearch -->

    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayniteAchievementsSearchDescription">Search on PlayniteAchievements data</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayniteAchievementsSearchHint" xml:space="preserve">Parameters:
    -percent&#x09;&#x09;Percent of progression (ex:-percent=50 / -percent=&lt;50 / -percent=&gt;50 / -percent=10&lt;&gt;50)
    -time&#x09;&#x09;Time to full unlock (ex:-time=5h / -time=&lt;50min / -time=&gt;50s / -time=10min&lt;&gt;5h)
    -np&#x09;&#x09;You didn't play the game
    -fav&#x09;&#x09;The game must be a favorite
    -stores={n}&#x09;Filter by store name (ex:-stores=steam / -stores=steam,epic)
    -status={n}&#x09;Filter by status name (ex:-status=played / -status=played,playing)</sys:String>


